
PandoraBox TEST IMAGE - root shell on the virtio console, never on a kiosk.

The kiosk draws on the screen (framebuffer), not here: see it over VNC
(display :0, port 5900) or print its texts with: kiosk-screen
  systemctl status pandora-box       kiosk service
  tail -f /var/log/pandora-box/pandora-box.log
  ls /var/lib/pandora-box/reports    scan reports
  shutdown now                       stop the kiosk (the virtual machine)

